================================================================================
DATA-USE DISCLAIMER
================================================================================
The MIT license above covers the CODE in this repository only.

This repository contains NO participant-level data. It ships source code and a
blank template variable dictionary. The datasets analysed in the associated
study — the National Health and Nutrition Examination Survey (NHANES) and the
Health and Retirement Study (HRS) — are NOT distributed here.

Each user must obtain those datasets directly from their source programs and
abide by the data-use agreements and terms set by:

  - NHANES / CDC National Center for Health Statistics
    https://www.cdc.gov/nchs/nhanes/
  - Health and Retirement Study, University of Michigan
    (sponsored by the National Institute on Aging, NIA U01AG009740)
    https://hrsdata.isr.umich.edu/

See RawData/RD_README.md for download and placement instructions.
